        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#NOTICE_MOD</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">你的魔能内容存在自定义修改，&#10;所以成就，在线积分以及&#10;VAC防作弊不能使用。&#10;如果不是故意为之，&#10;请重新使用Steam打开游戏，&#10;祝游戏开心</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Not shown to the avarage player. Only appears if one or more shared game files do not pass a hash-sum check.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">You are running a modified version of Magicka. Achievements, online leaderboards and VAC protected online games have been disabled. If this was not intentional, validate your game cache using the Steam client and restart the game. Otherwise, happy modding.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#NOTICE_MOD_CAMPAIGN</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">剧情内容存在自定义修改，&#10;所以成就，在线积分以及&#10;VAC防作弊不能使用。&#10;如果不是故意为之，&#10;请重新使用Steam打开游戏，&#10;祝游戏开心！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Shown when starting an adventure when the adventure does not pass the hash-sum check.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">This adventure is modified. Achievements and VAC protected online games are not available. If this was not intentional, validate your game cache using the Steam client and restart the game. Otherwise, happy modding.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#NOTICE_MOD_CAMPAIGN_VAC</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">剧情内容存在自定义修改，无法使用VAC防作弊功能。&#10;如果不是故意为之，&#10;请重新使用Steam打开游戏，&#10;关闭VAC防作弊，祝游戏开心！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Shown when trying to start hosting a game with VAC on and the campaign does not pass the hash-sum check.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Your adventure is modified and can not be used in a VAC protected game. If this was not intentional, validate your game cache using the Steam client and restart the game. Otherwise, turn off VAC and happy modding.</Data>
